---
import PhotoFrame from './PhotoFrame.astro';
---

<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 text-center" id="save-weekend">
  <div class="decor-line reveal"></div>
  <h2 class="font-script text-4xl md:text-5xl text-wedding-bronze mb-4 reveal">Nuestra Historia Continúa</h2>
  <p class="font-sans text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-wedding-bronze/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 reveal">
    Con mucha alegría e ilusión, queremos compartir con ustedes el día más especial de nuestras vidas. Acompáñennos a celebrar nuestro amor bajo el sol y la brisa del mar.
  </p>
  <div class="mb-6 reveal">
    <PhotoFrame src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/playa-atardecer.jpg`} alt="Atardecer tropical en la Isla de Margarita" className="w-full h-[52vh] sm:h-[60vh] md:h-[80vh]" imgClass="w-full h-full object-cover object-[50%_30%] opacity-75 saturate-[0.85] contrast-[1.08] brightness-[0.93]" />
  </div>
  <div class="decor-line reveal"></div>
  <h2 class="font-script text-4xl md:text-5xl text-wedding-bronze mb-4 reveal">Save the Weekend</h2>
  <p class="font-sans text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-wedding-bronze/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 reveal">
    Del 11 al 14 de Noviembre de 2026, los esperamos en la Isla de Margarita para celebrar juntos el amor.
  </p>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-8 reveal-group">
    <a href="#cocktail" class="block bg-wedding-sand/30 p-6 rounded-xl border border-wedding-accent/20 reveal hover:bg-wedding-sand/40 transition-colors cursor-pointer">
      <span class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-wedding-accent">Miércoles</span>
      <p class="font-serif text-3xl text-wedding-bronze my-1">11</p>
      <p class="font-sans text-sm font-light">Cóctel de Bienvenida</p>
    </a>
    <a href="#wedding" class="block bg-wedding-sand/30 p-6 rounded-xl border border-wedding-accent/20 reveal hover:bg-wedding-sand/40 transition-colors cursor-pointer">
      <span class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-wedding-accent">Jueves</span>
      <p class="font-serif text-3xl text-wedding-bronze my-1">12</p>
      <p class="font-sans text-sm font-light">Ceremonia &amp; Fiesta</p>
    </a>
    <div class="bg-wedding-sand/30 p-6 rounded-xl border border-wedding-accent/20 reveal">
      <span class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-wedding-accent">Viernes</span>
      <p class="font-serif text-3xl text-wedding-bronze my-1">13</p>
      <p class="font-sans text-sm font-light">Día de Playita</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-wedding-sand/30 p-6 rounded-xl border border-wedding-accent/20 reveal">
      <span class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-wedding-accent">Sábado</span>
      <p class="font-serif text-3xl text-wedding-bronze my-1">14</p>
      <p class="font-sans text-sm font-light">Despedida</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-8 w-full reveal">
    <PhotoFrame src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/Palmeras.jpg`} alt="Palmeras en la Isla de Margarita" />
  </div>
</section>
